[00:00.000] 作词 : 白艺潾
[00:00.150] 作曲 : 白艺潾
[00:00.300]I am your bunny that you hold tight, when you go to sleep (当你熟睡时我是被你紧紧握住的小兔子)
[00:08.660]I am your morning (我是你的清晨)
[00:10.906]I'm no sunshine (却不是一束暖阳)
[00:12.604]But you say I light up your world baby (但你说亲爱的你照亮了我的世界)
[00:16.810]I am your baby (我是你的甜心)
[00:19.291]That you won't let go, even If the world's go down (即使世界坍塌下来你都不会放手)
[00:25.247]Don't you worry (不要担心亲爱的)
[00:27.677]I will be anything (我会为你竭尽全力)
[00:29.923]Is that you wanna hear? (你想倾听吗？)
[00:31.935]So call me anything (那么全部都告诉我吧)
[00:35.122]I could be everything to you (我可以成为你的一切)
[00:38.126]But at the same time, I'd be nothing at all (一无所有如泡影般的我)
[00:42.436]Of course, now I'm very precious to you (却对你来说是无与伦比的存在)
[00:46.563]But I will still be needing time to have faith in you (但你我之间的信任需要时间来验证)
[00:53.277]
[01:07.331]For you I am burning (我为你所燃烧)
[01:09.734]Fastest I could (大步流星)
[01:11.797]For our loving (奔赴我们的爱)
[01:15.846]I would have nothing (一无所有的我)
[01:18.197]I'm very passionate (激情燃烧)
[01:20.444]I know so do you, my darling (亲爱的 我们心意相通)
[01:24.127]I am belonging (我的属于就像是)
[01:26.661]Like the sky above us includes the clouds and a sun (头顶的天空中的云与暖阳)
[01:32.669]I would be raining and be pouring through you (变成雨从你身上倾泻而下)
[01:37.241]Is that you wanna hear? (你想倾耳细听吗？)
[01:39.252]I'm telling everything (听我讲述万水千山)
[01:42.465]I could be everything to you (我可以成为你的一切)
[01:45.548]But at the same time, I'd be nothing at all (一无所有如泡影般的我)
[01:49.753]Of course, now I'm very precious to you (却对你来说是无与伦比的存在)
[01:53.985]But I will still be needing time to have faith in you (但你我之间的信任需要时间来验证)
